==Battleground==
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**9 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

